---------------------------

Qt 6 (Core, Gui, Widgets, Network, Test)
    Available under the GNU LGPL version 3, GPL version 2 or 3, or a commercial
    licence from The Qt Company. PiST uses it under the LGPLv3 and links Qt
    *dynamically*, which keeps the LGPL relink obligation satisfiable: a user who
    replaces the Qt libraries can still relink and run PiST. The complete
    corresponding source of the Qt version used must be made available, even
    unmodified.
    https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/licensing.html


No code from Hatari, vasm or Qt is included in this repository's sources.
